<#e63c96>SILVER CROW (ASSIST)</>
Rail Stinger		^X
Critical Dive		_D^X
  Calls Haruyuki when his gauge (the bar with the pink pig at the
  bottom of the screen) is full. Rail Stinger is the straight
  dash, Critical Dive the diving attack. Both cancel from
  normals on contact.

<#e63c96>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
Guard Counter (1 bar, while blocking)		_F^A_+^B
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B

<#e63c96>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Light into medium into heavy; every normal cancels into
  her specials on contact.

<#e63c96>SPECIALS</>
  C = EX (half a bar); without half a bar C gives the
  heavy version.
Death by Piercing		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  Also in the air.
Death by Barraging		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
Death by Flashing		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  Also in the air.
Evenflow (counter)		_B_D_DB^A / ^B / ^C

<#e63c96>EX (half a bar)</>
Vorpal Strike		_D_DF_F^C
  Also in the air.
The Eclipse		_F_D_DF^C
Genocide Ripper		_D_DB_B^C
  Also in the air.

<#e63c96>SUPERS</>
Death by Embracing (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C. Half damage at one bar.
Starburst Stream (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Level 3. Damage is capped.
